   "description": "Description Two-tone, two-layer dial with orange hands in an electric blue case inspired by Ferrari 250 GT Lusso. and so is the classy electric blue colour of the case. The Sconvolto logotype is moved all the way to the bottom of the dial to preserve its cleanliness, the open V leads the eyes to the date well, with its keen orange background. A s oft white leather and caoutchouc bracelet bring the signature Sconvolto buckle, black as the watch crown. Specifications Case: 7075-T651 heat treated aluminium alloy. Hand-polished, anodized and EPD coated. 41x55mm, 75 grams (including bracelet). Shatterproof, distortion-free PMMA crystal. Brass crown, PVD coated black. Bracelet: Italian calfskin and premium natural rubber. Steel buckle, PVD coated black. Movement: Miyota 9015, 24 jewels, 28800bph. 42hrs power reserve. 2 years warranty. Available only on Beautiful Machines website.",
